  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Hulhumalé opened on 12 May 2004 with about 1,000 residents. After the Sinamalé Bridge and the Hiyaa flats, it had 78,299 people in 2022: 65,714 residents and 12,585 expatriates. Growth is expected to stay strong, with the Thilamalé bridge and building in all three phases. At full build-out, the plan houses about 349,094 people by 2050."
